WEBVTT

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:03.100
<i>It's the World Duel Carnival Tournament Finals!</i>

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.810
<i>

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.400
</i>Out of the 23 best Duelists who survived the preliminaries!

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.110
<i>Here goes! I'm aiming for Duel Champion!</i>

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.110
<i>I'm gonna bring it to 'em!</i>

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.540
Yuma, the fireworks are starting!

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.500
Today's the Duel Carnival Tournament Finals, right?

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.090
How long are you gonna keep sleeping?

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.960
C'mon, get up alr-

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:33.760
Huh?

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:36.510
He's not here.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.220
Grandma!

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:43.980
Hey, where's Yuma?

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:48.110
Oh, in order to make sure he definitely isn't late,

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:52.030
he slept outside the entrance to Heartland all night.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.530
And he was so pumped up...

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.990
He's such a moron!

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:03.750
Yuma is experiencing the importance of this tournament in his own way.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:08.000
<i>The fireworks have announced the start of the World Duel Carnival-</i>

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:08.000
<i>Cleaning. Idiot's room. Cleaning.</i>

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.670
Shark's so cool!

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.970
I hear that Kaito fellow's pretty hot too!

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:20.510
There's only 23 remaining among more than 10,000 participants.

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:21.930
This should be an awesome tournament!

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:25.020
Yeah! They're all incredible Duelists!

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:26.690
I wonder who will win the championship?

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:28.270
IV for sure!

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:30.520
That hurts!

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.150
Why are you sleeping out <i>here</i>?

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:35.740
Man...

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:37.860
What was that all of a sudden?

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:40.450
What're you guys doing here?

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:42.700
He's still half-alseep.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:45.870
To summarize, he thinks this is his room.

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:47.830
He's like a wild kitty.

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.830
Wake up and open your eyes!

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:51.460
This is Heartland!

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:54.840
Today's the starting day of the World Duel Carnival Tournament Finals!

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:57.630
Duel Carnival...?

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:00.970
That's right!

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:02.970
Yup, yup, yup, yup!

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.970
He really is an idiot.

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:09.810
Man, it would've been bad if I overslept!

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:13.820
Then there was no point in sleeping in front of the entrance, was there?

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:17.320
Hey, the opening ceremony is about to begin.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.400
We've got to hurry.

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:22.870
- Oh crap, crap, crap!
 - Wait up!

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.170
Amazing!

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:40.300
It's huge!

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.760
We're gonna Duel here?!

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:43.890
It's awesome!

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:50.560
Does this mean some kind of Field Magic has been casted?

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:52.940
No! This is real!

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:56.020
Either way, this is incredible!

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:01.860
Heart Burning!

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:06.990
I now declare the start of the World Duel Carnival Tournament Finals!

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:12.750
The first stage will be the Park Section!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.750
In other words, we will Duel using this entire Heartland as the stage!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.960
Going by the name Duel Coasters!

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.920
Duel Coasters?

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:24.550
To summarize, they Duel using those roller coasters.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:25.970
But how?

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.270
I'm not really sure...

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.730
But doesn't it sound interesting?

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.060
Right, Yuma?

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:34.060
Yeah, bring on whatever!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.860
It'd be a shame if I can't enjoy this, seeing as how I made it this far!

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.150
But Yuma, aren't you going?

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:44.110
Gosh...

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:46.200
You can do it, Yuma!

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.330
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:57.940
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:03.280
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:20.130
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:25.930
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:30.520
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:36.560
<i>It's too late for us to turn back now</i>

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:41.650
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:47.200
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:53.000
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:58.040
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:03.510
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:09.180
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:15.350
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:21.440
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:27.300
<i>Now then, the 23 Duelists who won in the preliminaries to get here,</i>

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:31.930
<i>Muster up every bit of your intellect and your strength to fight!</i>

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:35.390
Number 51: "Here we come, Tournament Finals! 
Duel Coasters, Go!"

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:38.100
<i>And set that prestigious title of first ever World Duel Champion as your goal!!</i>

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:54.330
Amazing!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.210
So these are the Duel Coasters?!

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.920
I'm getting excited!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.710
You'll get hurt badly if you get too worked up.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.670
Duel Coasters are no game.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:06.130
You're... Droite!

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:08.890
Indeed, what Droite said is true.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:11.600
This will be a true showdown that puts our lives on the line.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.060
Gauche!

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:15.980
But be sure to enjoy it!

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:17.730
Right!

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:19.150
Of course!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.690
It's IV! IV!

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.280
Wow, he's so cool!

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:39.540
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, please, you must take good care of your body.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.750
Orbital, stop time.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.220
I'm about to search for those holding Numbers.

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:52.970
B-But if you do that, you'll end up revealing yourself to Number Holders instead!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:56.180
0.1 seconds is good enough! Hurry and do it!

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.140
U-Understood!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:17.240
Okay.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.920
Just now...

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.010
H-He noticed after all!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:33.510
You did your job, so get lost!

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:35.970
U-Understood!

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.270
Man, some awesome members are gathered here!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.600
This should be a blast!

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:48.230
Among them are Kaito and Shark...

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:50.400
And excluding Tron and his group,

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.950
there is bound to be a number of powerful opponents here.

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:55.870
This is so freaking cool!

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.120
I'm getting pumped!

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.500
So that's our prey, right?

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.760
<i>Then we'll start with a small deposit.</i>

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.340
<i>The rest comes when you complete your job.</i>

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.590
<i>And the target is...?</i>

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:18.100
<i>A boy named Yuma Tsukumo.</i>

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:25.940
They were gathered...

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.020
They've been gathered here.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:32.990
Kaito, you must retrieve those Numbers!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:40.660
<i>Now! Soon enough, we will fire the signal!</i>

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:43.960
<i>Fellow warriors, prepare for battle!</i>

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:51.590
These Duel Coasters will link to your D-Pads!

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.840
Duel Disk, set!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.940
D-Gazer, set!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:36.130
<i>AR Vision - Link established.</i>

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:41.760
At last, the time has come to bet your lives in these Coasters!

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:44.640
The Heart Pieces you all gathered during the preliminaries

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.940
will act as the starting key for the Duel Coaster!

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:52.780
Set your Heart Pieces in the designated location in the cockpit!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.240
So that's a map, huh?

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:06.660
What the? There's M and T marks all over the thing.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:09.580
"Magic" and "Traps"... I see.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.000
This is well thought out.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:16.550
They're gone! Gone, gone! My Heart Pieces're gone!

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.630
Where'd I leave them?!

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:22.140
Yuma keeps looking down.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:23.970
What the heck is he doing?

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:26.520
Maybe the mental pressure made him snap?

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:32.360
Why's he fooling around at a time like this?

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:36.280
No... He doesn't seem to be fooling around.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:41.990
<i>Cleaning done. Cleaning done. Found heart in idiot's room.</i>

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:43.410
A heart?

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.200
<i>This. This.</i>

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.200
Wait, that's...!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.870
Heart Pieces!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.920
My Heart Pieces're gone! What'll I do?!

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:57.260
<i>Yuma! Akari-</i>san<i> just contacted me.</i>

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:59.680
<i>They found your Heart Pieces in your room!</i>

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.470
<i>They're on there way to Heartland.</i>

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.850
My sis did?! I owe her one!

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:05.390
<i>Wait!</i>

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:08.520
<i>Stay there, Yuma!</i>

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:13.230
Got it, everyone?!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:14.360
- Yeah!
 - Yeah!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.150
The time has now come!

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:22.070
We shall now drop the curtain on this stage of battle that will determine the best in history!

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:25.280
Already?! They didn't make it in time at all!

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.160
We start in ten!

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.200
Nine!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.290
Eight!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.160
Seven!

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.170
Six!

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:32.170
Five!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.000
Four!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.250
Three!

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:34.960
- Heart Pieces!
 - Two!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.170
One!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:37.710
Fire!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:50.680
Oh my! Only one, Contestant Yuma Tsukumo's Coaster, didn't start!

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:52.390
Did he encounter some trouble?!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.440
They left! Hurry and get here, Sis!

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:05.450
Akari-<i>san</i>!

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:09.160
I'm counting on you!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:12.330
Right!

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:16.210
I'll leave it to you!

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:18.750
Okay!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:25.050
Pass!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:27.970
Leave it to me!

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.350
Whoa!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:39.860
I'm on my way, Yuma!

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:42.990
Kotori!

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:48.740
Catch!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:53.870
God, she won't make it in time!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:54.750
Yuma!

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:56.460
Kotori!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.880
Here's your Heart Pieces! Catch!

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:14.980
Yes, it's moving! Here I go!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.190
Hey, Yuma!

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:18.860
Huh? Why are you in here too, Kotori?

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:21.480
I was running and I ended up in here before I realized it!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.120
Now I can't get off...

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.750
Hang on tight, Kotori!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.830
Since it's come to this, the two of us will have to fight together!

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:37.000
You mean three.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.790
I'm here too.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.250
This is an unexpected development!

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:48.800
Contestant Yuma, who had a delayed start, has ridden into view with a girl in tow!

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.140
The Coasters were originally made for one.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:56.600
However, as the founder of this tournament,
 I shall personally permit it!

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:05.070
This is feels amazing! Coasters are the best!

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.860
Slow down a little!

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:11.620
I can't do that! I've already fallen far behind the others!

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:17.920
But how do we Duel in these things when you can't even find your opponent?

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:20.460
I'm riding on one lane all by myself...

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:21.920
Look, Yuma.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.840
There's two Coasters riding one land.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:31.260
Move, move, move! I'll send anyone in my way flying like a bullet!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:32.890
Draw!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.850
I Summon Heroic Challenger - Spartas!

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:46.780
My opponent's got Blood Storm. Interesting!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:51.160
Then I'll just activate the Magic Card Force from my hand!

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:56.660
This card's effect halves Blood Storm's Attack Power...

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.250
...and increases Spartas' Attack Points by the same amount!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.210
Go! Attack him!

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.220
Straight Javelin!!

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.970
Unbelievable!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:27.900
Thank goodness...

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:38.080
If we take even one wrong step here, we'll suffer heavy injuries.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:38.620
Yeah...

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:45.210
You're ten years too early to be riding in front of my lane!

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:49.210
I get it.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:53.930
If you're on the same lane as someone else, you have to Duel them.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:54.600
Right.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:16:00.310
Plus, you can switch lanes freely if you wish to fight the person you encounter.

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:09.030
Go, Jaws!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.070
Shark Scream!!

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:15.700
I have no shame!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.750
Wow... That's Shark for you!

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:24.920
Goodness... Where's Yuma?

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:30.460
You're putting on quite the show!

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.010
You won't get away, IV!

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:39.720
I swear to utterly crush you in this tournament!

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.270
Big mouth for such a weakling!

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.770
I Summon Gimmick Puppet - Bomb Egg!

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:55.660
Direct Attack! Go!

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.030
Yes, bomb!

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:08.040
Be gone, trash!

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.710
As always, he's always lusting for blood.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:16.260
Despite having no idea what kind of prolonged battle awaits us in the near future.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:23.020
Thus, rather than battling, I should invest all my attention toward protecting and increasing my Life Points.

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:33.650
You are in my way! Move at once!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:36.200
Send him flying, Vylon Disigma!

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.120
Direct Attac-

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.950
Wha...What the?

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:48.500
Those who dare to come close to me shall be consumed by Hell's Inferno!

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:52.460
I activate the Trap Card, Sun of the Abyss!

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:58.720
When a Monster holding 2000 or more Attack Points attacks me directly,

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:03.680
this card deals the opposing player 800 points of damage for each card he holds in his hand!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:07.890
What?!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:24.490
As I suspected, this is a 'Magic Point'.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:28.170
Moreover, the set card was the God of Healing, Dian Keto.

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:34.090
The effect of this card increases my Life Points by 1000 points!

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.300
Well done, V.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:42.930
IV and Shark are both fighting relentlessly with all of their might.

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:44.310
As for him...

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:47.730
How is Yuma Tsukumo faring?

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:53.730
Everyone's so strong! Man, I so wanna start Dueling already!

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:56.820
Your wish may soon me granted.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:58.030
Look up ahead.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:58.780
Huh?

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.450
But... I just passed them by.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.670
Thanks to this guy's late start,

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:16.340
we don’t need to lure him out from the group.

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:19.300
All we gotta do is crush him like we promised!

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.510
Then we'll be rolling in dough!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:28.390
That's right. I will pay you as much money as you want.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:33.230
Only <i>after</i> you show me just how strong Yuma Tsukumo really is.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.780
Let's go! As we planned before, we'll use Formation One!

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:40.150
Roger!

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.120
They're catching up to us!

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.250
What's with these guys?

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:58.000
Clearly they've been waiting to ambush you, Yuma!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:03.340
They're attacking from both sides to prevent you from escaping to the side lanes!

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:07.850
That's dangerous, you know!

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.810
Darn! I'm gonna get away from you!

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.530
There's a 'T' mark up ahead...

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.370
A Trap Card?!

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:35.920
That was Underground Machine Gun.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:40.960
It deals 200 points of damage for every card you have in your hand and on the field.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:44.260
How can you say that so calmly?!

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:49.310
So they set Magic and Trap Cards throughout the course?

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:54.980
I can't believe he didn't notice such an obvious trap.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:58.440
His Dueling skills must not be anything to brag about!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:02.900
Then let’s finish him off as soon as possible so we can go home and count our cash!

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:07.370
<i>Hey, kid. Duel against us.</i>

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.870
What?!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.620
Here goes! Formation Two!

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:12.790
Roger!

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:19.460
They caught up so fast!

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:23.670
I Summon Magnet Eagle Delta from my hand!

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:26.840
I Summon Magnet Saucer!

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:30.100
I Summon Magnet Saucer as well!

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:43.280
They already Summoned Monsters?!

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:44.900
And it's three-on-one!

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.990
This has become a three-on-one battle from the get-go!

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:49.950
Is this the Duel Coaster's...?

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:54.790
No, a testament of the World Duel Carnival Final?!

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:01.460
Now then, let's see it, Yuma Tsukumo.

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:03.840
Just how strong are you?

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:15.640
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:21.270
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.900 --> 00:22:31.950
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:36.250
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.250 --> 00:22:37.540
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:40.250
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:42.880
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:48.050
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:53.430
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.510 --> 00:22:59.060
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:05.530
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:16.290
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:21.880
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:27.130
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:32.640
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:44.310
A huge battle is underway between the Finalists who made it to the Coasters!

00:23:44.310 --> 00:23:46.610
Let's go, Duel Coasters!

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:51.860
But in the beginning, a trio named Fallguys have ambushed me!

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:55.330
And when I was in a desperate situation, she...!

00:23:55.330 --> 00:23:57.870
Yuma, they're aiming for you.

00:23:57.870 --> 00:23:58.620
What?!

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:00.210
The lane's been blocked!

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:02.460
That's their team play!

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:04.420
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:06.880
The Duel Coasters Vs the Rampaging Train!

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:09.300
Hey, why the heck are you here?!

00:24:10.920 --> 00:24:14.760
Excalibur is a sword wielded by a king long ago.

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:16.350
That's got nothing to do with the Great Me!

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:18.350
I didn't say Great Me, I said King.
 (Note: <i>oresama</i>, <i>ousama</i>)

00:24:18.350 --> 00:24:20.310
You tryin' ta' praise me?

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:21.770
That's <i>Osaka</i>!

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:22.940
You best be cuttin' it out!
